{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>אשר יקוט</b> — The Gaon [Saadia] interpreted it as <b>חבל</b> the sun [i.e., a sun-rope], and it is far-fetched, therefore it is from ונקוטותם. And he interpreted <b>כסלו</b> as his trust, as in: \"If I made gold my כסלי.\""], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:08.940952810Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}